# CR 700.13 and its ruling: "The spell or ability that constituted a crime doesn't have to have resolved yet or at all."
# Bot1 aims Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Llanowar Elves: a crime, and Raven of Fell Omens triggers. Bot2 answers with
# Snakeskin Veil, and the Bolt's only target is illegal as it tries to resolve, so it does not resolve (CR 608.2b). The
# crime was committed all the same: the Raven's drain happened (Bot2 at 19, Bot1 at 21) and Bot1's crime is recorded.

